WEBVTT

NOTE
This is a major FMV sequence lasting approximately 59 seconds depicting the Timber TV Station broadcast. The Galbadian military has taken over the station, and Seifer holds President Vinzer Deling hostage on the broadcast stage. The scene captures the confrontation, the worldwide broadcast, and the arrival of Sorceress Edea. Tension escalates as the situation becomes increasingly chaotic.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
The exterior of the Timber TV Station building. A tall broadcast tower extends from the roof, topped with multiple satellite dishes. The building is modern with large glass windows. The evening sky is overcast above.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Multiple satellite dishes rotate on the station roof. Broadcasting equipment is visible. Transmission cables and antenna arrays extend skyward. The broadcast signal is active and transmitting nationwide.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
The interior broadcast stage. Bright studio lights hang overhead. Camera equipment points toward a raised platform. Seifer stands on the broadcast stage holding his gunblade to President Deling's throat. Deling is visibly distressed, his formal suit disheveled.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Seifer's face is intense and defiant. His gunblade gleams under the studio lights as he holds it against Deling's neck. The president appears calm despite the threat, his eyes fixed ahead. The broadcast camera is recording their every move.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Quistis and other SeeD members rush into the broadcast studio. They take tactical positions, surveying the scene. Seifer does not move from his position holding the president hostage. The military standoff is at maximum tension.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
The broadcast camera displays Seifer and President Deling on monitors throughout the TV station. The image is being transmitted live across the nation. Technicians at their workstations monitor the broadcast signal. The feed goes out worldwide simultaneously.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Citizens across Galbadia watch the broadcast on their television screens. The image of Seifer holding the president hostage appears in homes, businesses, and public spaces. The nation witnesses the confrontation in real time. Shock registers on the faces of people watching.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Seifer's confrontation with the president continues on live television. His gunblade reflects the bright studio lights. Deling's expression remains composed despite the danger. The broadcast continues uninterrupted.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:45.000
The studio entrance doors burst open. Sorceress Edea arrives, her presence commanding immediate attention. She walks forward with supernatural confidence. Her horned headdress catches the light. Her flowing dark robes sweep behind her. The atmosphere in the studio transforms with her arrival.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Edea moves toward Seifer and the president. Her eyes glow with magical power. She raises her hand, and dark energy radiates from her form. Seifer appears mesmerized by her presence. The studio is bathed in an otherworldly light.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Seifer lowers his gunblade. He steps back from the president. Edea's control over the situation is absolute. She and Seifer exchange looks of understanding. President Deling is released from his immediate threat.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:59.000
The broadcast continues showing the dramatic conclusion. Edea's presence dominates the studio. The image is transmitted across the nation as the final scene fades to black.
